// BYOB readers on an IdentityTransformStream's readable, an internal stream
// in workerd: a read answers with a Uint8Array whatever the view's type, a
// tee() branch takes a BYOB reader, and releaseLock() throws while a read is
// in flight. celld answered with the view's type, refused BYOB on a branch,
// and released the lock, rejecting the read (plan 1.26).
{
  "name": "app",
  "main": "index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-01-01"
}
